[I] Print extension headers

[T] printproto contains the protocol headers for the Xprint extension, a
[T] portable, network-transparent printing system for X11. Xprint is no
[T] longer maintained; the package is kept for compatibility of libXp and
[T] applications using it.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/proto/printproto

